# Peragus, the administration level again and the Harbinger (TSL, 101PER,
# 151HAR to 153HAR): Kreia rejoins, Atton, HK-50 fought (the HK
# vocabulator), the Harbinger: Kreia's influence (light), the bridge's
# navicomputer sliced for the drift charts, the crew quarters, the engine
# deck: Atton's bad feeling, Sion and Kreia, the maintenance doors and the
# ion engines, out through the fuel pipe. Starts from the dormitories':
#   kjk playthrough tsl @peragus_admin_again data/routes/tsl/peragus_harbinger.route --god
# Walkthroughs: DSimpson's "The Administration Level Again", "Harbinger",
# "Harbinger Crew Quarters", "Engine Deck, Harbinger"; GameBanshee's
# (context/walkthroughs/tsl/).
to WP_KREIA_SPAWN2    # forward from the turbolift: the door opens, Kreia
say Then let's go    # rejoins
talk
gather
fight 30             # Sith assassins following
to tr_atton_see_hk   # on to Atton; HK-50 stops the party's flight and
                     # admits the miners' deaths
fight 30             # HK-50 and his four floating mines
use HK50             # his remains: the HK vocabulator
exit 151HARDoor      # up the ramp to the Harbinger
# The Harbinger's command deck: Atton and Kreia argue; respect Kreia (+INF).
say Forgive me, Kreia
talk
fight 30
leader 0             # Atton at the navicomputer ([Computer], a spike):
say Slice the navicomputer # the drift charts downloaded
say Download the orbital drift charts
say Log out
use NavcomI
talk
fight 30             # Sith assassins in the halls
unlock Hammerhead1@1 # back by the boarding ramp, the low security door
unlock Hammerhead1@8 # (Atton's Security), and the next one
leader player
exit To_152HAR       # the crew quarters (open with the charts)
use PCDoor           # the Exile's room: the armband, the datapad
fight 30
say Insert datapad   # the medical bay's console: the datapad inserted (the
say Identify kolto tank # Exile was drugged here too), the tank identified
say =Log out.
use MedCon
talk
exit Door_To_153HAR  # the turbolift down to the engine deck
# The engine deck: Atton's bad feeling (+INF: what's wrong, be careful);
# Sion behind, Kreia seals the door and stays to fight him.
say What's wrong
say We'll have to be careful
talk
to Sion_Spawn        # on toward the intersection: Sion comes up behind,
talk                 # Kreia seals the door and stays
leader 0             # Atton slices the maintenance control: the doors to
unlock Hammerhead1@4 # the low security door to the maintenance room
say Slice the maintenance control system # the ion engines
say Open maintenance doors
say Log out
use MainCon
talk
unlock Hammerhead1@3 # up the hall, the other low security door: a
                     # footlocker of components and a workbench
use CivilFootLker    # by the workbench: parts and spikes
unlock MilLowFootLker@6 # the maintenance room's locked footlocker (DC 18;
use MilLowFootLker@6 # the other six of the tag are empty props)
leader player
say Activate Engine Maintenance Procedure # the main ion engine control
use EngCom
talk
say Atton, you need to trust me # through the next door Atton balks at the
to AttonFuelBanter   # fuel pipe (LSP); Kreia and Sion
talk
exit TO_103PER       # through the fuel pipe, back into the fuel depot
save peragus_escape
